GAJlyve85WvWesnTwdcpreCIiaic0cFibQZEoxpYoYCC7J1382bEsdML1TYWC0yTgqwIKYTic7jCAzT3uxaqu14MrDQtR6ECorGKNpVeoQibqibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85VfkoOGeyXXfZ19xKaGVKfmEPmTa2ychpzlWNKdZopfKgBCJaic1p70o3ZhCOTOBjAgz6g0OXpibycKnm8fCLKh2dBKc0J0TVQ1k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>高等研究院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85UYbl7FxnDvsrXx3doIxY7AqYh9wAzn1JZf4qL8NBWtbEoYUKEbViaQSBpib9j9ZeFcuDlKO4LNrA0XiasHickyByMjWkRXkgVIkibg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>深圳大学高等研究院成立于2014年，是深圳大学的一个创新综合办学单位，突出小规模、高水平、跨学科、重基础、研究型、国际化的培养模式，下设数学与应用数学、物理学、化学、生物科学四个基础学科方向。近年来，高等研究院围绕空间科学、微生物组学、合成生物学、纳米科学、数据科学等交叉领域，开展创新人才培养、尖端科学研究和高新技术开发。学院现有专任教师52名，专职研究人员20名，博士后80名，拥有多名国家级人才。近5年，在Nature、Nature Communications、Physical Review Letters等国际知名期刊发表论文千余篇。过去三年中毕业的硕士研究生约1/3选择继续深造。国外去向包括：普林斯顿大学、美国西北大学、新加坡国立大学等国际知名学府；国内去向包括：北京大学、中山大学、厦门大学、上海交通大学、复旦大学、华南理工大学等。此外，约2/3的硕士毕业生选择就业，进入华为、TCL、福田区教育局等知名企业或事业单位工作。高等研究院根据课程特点、学生能力和教学效果，采用中英双语教学。目前，学院研究生规模达到250余人，设有数学、物理学、化学、以及生物学4个学术硕士学位点对外招生。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aGAJlyve85XY1hwrDWR0QY84uD1K1TMJlkadeMtgcdDd40iaHcWwtmhLxias1Y5DO0H3icp6rnzkFawCYRiaLnUjFdYR2WeeFyvbgSiaRvQZGAlM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国具有硕士推免权高校（含本校）的本科三年级在校生（2027届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2.优先考虑数学、物理学、化学、生物学等基础学科方向；</span></p><p><span>3.对基础科研工作有浓厚兴趣、有较好的创新能力、团队组织能力和沟通能力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学术硕士：</span></p><p><span>070100数学</span></p><p><span>070200物理学</span></p><p><span>070300化学</span></p><p><span>071000生物学</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85W55jYJ6jOOEtzAjXyd0R6AFuwyaf1bhFllSpvibmlkIkia2ViarWBO2s1pRiazsDbHLGFHKtJCeXwg2iapcpIbPiam29N2plDII4Fm8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85VoRETGicbxlFgVfDV4TlpI2kWYg16Fw8cr9cznicibBZzicGPQ9S4evvjae0YIe9xsFm5tzqcP5Wupov65d4QicWricNO4yzfA9razA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85Xo7hVuN33DuqYGhTvRxuaV0C0HE3jor1Msoobc2dZeM6TTj3NnMD5lkYyNahz6jicvoFGJBdaMR4JBgTicAHX3AGyWkhL6OoicUw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85VpCdyjj942l2Eiaw38ia8A7rLBozjPyeC9hFE1ZNgzAOPTJulRCudY0p97SpINGEYOhY8N9q0uNEUJWUnKtZwZhjyibt1WBEjicRU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>暑期学校活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aGAJlyve85Vk1BofCBYcUyia445akLwET3BwqAB7GeU8kAx4QNxTXqf3412F9lPR0l7hCZfS2b8f7lRzwR2WYJtWCX62zjfF80LicFTvnZ8qI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>时间安排：7月7日-10日</span></p><p><span>活动地点：深圳大学粤海校区</span></p><p><span>活动内容：学术报告、师生交流、校园参观等（以现场活动安排表为准）</span></p><p><span>活动费用：暑期学校期间学院免费提供食宿，暑期学校期间由高等研究院安排的集中学习或考察活动均免费。学员须按要求参加全程的活动</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>有意向申请的同学自即日起通过以下链接预报名，</span><span><span>网址</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><strong><span>http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm</span></strong><span><span>，并按系统要求提交本人以下各项材料：</span></span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证扫描件或者照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>网上申请截止时间：6月28日（拟定），届时将视情况而定是否延期。我院收到申请后，将尽快组织评委进行选拔，并通过邮件及电话方式通知录取结果。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/aGAJlyve85USmywqn7Zus99Ya30Bxfq4Nm46gGMlcSY2Mdplslhiav4dT0u1yCcTquNUQ1GdFIZAVG66q0iaG4XtPIIMIwkXIW0ApiaMYXwoBM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><